<title>USA: Trump buys Miss Universe Co from Madison Sq Garden.</title>
<headline>Trump buys Miss Universe Co from Madison Sq Garden.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Madison Square Garden LP said on Wednesday that it sold the Miss Universe Co to real estate and casino tycoon Donald Trump.</p>
<p>Miss Universe Co includes the Miss Universe, Miss Teen USA and Miss USA beauty contests, said Madison Square Garden, a partnership of ITT Corp and Cablevision Systems Corp.</p>
<p>Madison Square Garden, which owns the New York City arena and two professional sports teams, said the pageants no longer fit into its strategic plans.</p>
</text>
